{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest of Them All is a <strong>ball-rolling speedrunning game</strong> built like Ninja Warrior.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop, roll, and bounce across a variety of balance, flow, climb, and technical tracks. Earn medals, climb the global leaderboards, then explore what other players have built in the Hub.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and smooth gameplay, you\u2019ll find yourself hitting \u201cR\u201d over and over for the perfect run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CIRCUIT </strong>\u2013 8 bite-sized tracks where all your best times are collected for a seasonal score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIALS</strong> \u2013 Climb The Tower, alone or in a public lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUB</strong> - Explore tracks cooked up by the community \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS - </strong>Fight your friends or the world for the best time on every track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOSTS - </strong>Race against ghost records set by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRACK EDITOR - </strong>Build whatever you can imagine and share it with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BALL CUSTOMIZATION - </strong>Complete challenges to unlock new skins and accessories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about flow. The smoother you are, the better your time. Plan your route carefully and nail the execution to keep your speed from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower is an extreme challenge in the style of Deep Dip and other climb maps. Invite your friends to a lobby and start rolling to find out which one of you is the Ballest of Them All.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/332c03b9508b81fcd7cd458937b98603.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/332c03b9508b81fcd7cd458937b98603.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Track Editor has the tools to make whatever you can imagine. Whether it\u2019s bite-sized or colossal, fast or tricky, or whatever\u2013it\u2019s yours to share with the community\u2026 just don\u2019t be surprised if they beat you on your own track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THANKS FOR CLICKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now put a hat on your ball and get rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest is built by a tiny team that grew up on games like Trials, Trackmania, and Super Monkey Ball. We have big plans for Ballest, and I hope you see a little bit of all your favorite games inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re playing in a language other than English, please let me know about any mistakes I made and I will fix them ASAP. If you're playing in English, I swear it's my first language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Show Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"One Wet Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Great Heights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"It's MY track now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Air Apparent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"I Would Roll 500 Miles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Bouncy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"},{"name":"Grounded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339810/fdf6dfff86517a53bbba1076437322c487ced177.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339810?t=1761838303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761838303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/6a671f394f333cd5c229e08689af299a836aac87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761838303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/6a671f394f333cd5c229e08689af299a836aac87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761838303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest of Them All is a <strong>ball-rolling speedrunning game</strong> built like Ninja Warrior.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop, roll, and bounce across a variety of balance, flow, climb, and technical tracks. Earn medals, climb the global leaderboards, then explore what other players have built in the Hub.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and smooth gameplay, you\u2019ll find yourself hitting \u201cR\u201d over and over for the perfect run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CIRCUIT </strong>\u2013 8 bite-sized tracks where all your best times are collected for a seasonal score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIALS</strong> \u2013 Climb The Tower, alone or in a public lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUB</strong> - Explore tracks cooked up by the community \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS - </strong>Fight your friends or the world for the best time on every track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOSTS - </strong>Race against ghost records set by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRACK EDITOR - </strong>Build whatever you can imagine and share it with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BALL CUSTOMIZATION - </strong>Complete challenges to unlock new skins and accessories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/a8a05c4ed31a67690d4a14240bc5cb54.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about flow. The smoother you are, the better your time. Plan your route carefully and nail the execution to keep your speed from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/f3ca26df5e5c208c1a8721cfad1b9128.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower is an extreme challenge in the style of Deep Dip and other climb maps. Invite your friends to a lobby and start rolling to find out which one of you is the Ballest of Them All.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/332c03b9508b81fcd7cd458937b98603.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/332c03b9508b81fcd7cd458937b98603.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Track Editor has the tools to make whatever you can imagine. Whether it\u2019s bite-sized or colossal, fast or tricky, or whatever\u2013it\u2019s yours to share with the community\u2026 just don\u2019t be surprised if they beat you on your own track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/0a6185105ee77c2abc37e9b7e68c059a.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THANKS FOR CLICKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now put a hat on your ball and get rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.poster.avif?t=1761838303\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.webm?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/82ccfd16e031baff2a7606ad5cd192c6.mp4?t=1761838303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballest is built by a tiny team that grew up on games like Trials, Trackmania, and Super Monkey Ball. We have big plans for Ballest, and I hope you see a little bit of all your favorite games inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re playing in a language other than English, please let me know about any mistakes I made and I will fix them ASAP. If you're playing in English, I swear it's my first language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gumption Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing",